    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19300" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gargānus</span></b> , i,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				mountain ridge in Apulia on which storms are frequent</i>, now
				<i>Monte Gargano</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 13, 18, § 111 al.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Hor.
				C. 2, 9, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 11, 247</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 5,
				380 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Deriv. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gargānus</span></b> , a, um, adj.,
				<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			Garganus</i>, <i>Gargan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 2, 1, 202</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cacumina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil. 9,
					34</span></i>
			.</div>
